    <briefdescription>
<para>YAML-loadable regex-based lexical rewrite rule. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Applies a single regex pattern-to-replacement transformation. Thread-safe after construction. Regex is precompiled for efficiency. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
